  "prefLabel": "Plc 202.26 Via electronic means",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 202.26 “Via electronic means” means using a video teleconference electronic meeting platform that enables all participants to communicate with each other contemporaneously, such as, but not limited to, WebEx®, Zoom®, GoToMeeting®, or GoToWebinar®.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (formerly Plc 202.22) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200); ss by #14136, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.36)",
